<title>UK: London, Korean stock exchanges to sign pact.</title>
<headline>London, Korean stock exchanges to sign pact.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The London Stock Exchange (LSE) said on Thursday it will sign a memorandum of understanding with the Korea Stock Exchange on Friday that will encourage more Korean companies to list in London.</p>
<p>There are currently 12 Korean companies listed on the LSE.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 5106</p>
